# Before implementing any fix from an aged issue (preference)

Standing user preference: Before implementing any fix from an aged issue or todo, verify the diagnosed root cause still holds in the current codebase — the fix may already be present or the real gap may have shifted.

## Conventions
- Before implementing any fix from an aged issue or todo, verify the diagnosed root cause still holds in the current codebase — the fix may already be present or the real gap may have shifted.

